   .. group-tab:: LCD backlight

      Operate with the LCD backlight switch as voltage regulator,
      :rpi-pico-sys:`BL_EN` at :rpi-pico-pio:`GP20`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **regulator vlist lcd-backlight-en**
            3.300000 V
            0 uV

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **regulator vget lcd-backlight-en**
            3.300000 V

      The off/on sequence:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **regulator vset lcd-backlight-en 0V**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **regulator vset lcd-backlight-en 3300mV**

   .. group-tab:: LED Group (RGB)

      .. note:: **PWM LED conflicts with GPIO!**

         Operations with the user LEDs in PWM mode will fail when ever
         the corresponding GPIO lines were configured as digital output.
         This condition is irreversible at runtime within the shell and
         :strong:`requires a system reset`.

      Operate with the RGB LED, grouped from the three single-user LEDs:

      - :hwftlbl-led:`LED_R` at :rpi-pico-pio:`GP6` / :rpi-pico-pwm:`PWM6` (PWM3CHA)
      - :hwftlbl-led:`LED_G` at :rpi-pico-pio:`GP7` / :rpi-pico-pwm:`PWM7` (PWM3CHB)
      - :hwftlbl-led:`LED_B` at :rpi-pico-pio:`GP8` / :rpi-pico-pwm:`PWM8` (PWM4CHA)

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led get_info pwm-rgb-led 0**
            pwm-rgb-led: getting LED 0 information
            Label      : <NULL>
            Index      : 0
            Num colors : 3
            Colors     : red:green:blue

      Set LED group to :brd:`RED`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_color pwm-rgb-led 0 100 0 0**
            pwm-rgb-led: setting LED 0 color to 100:0:0

      Set LED group to :byl:`YELLOW`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_color pwm-rgb-led 0 100 100 0**
            pwm-rgb-led: setting LED 0 color to 100:100:0

      Set LED group to :bgn:`GREEN`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_color pwm-rgb-led 0 0 100 0**
            pwm-rgb-led: setting LED 0 color to 0:100:0

      Set LED group to :bcy:`CYAN`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_color pwm-rgb-led 0 0 100 100**
            pwm-rgb-led: setting LED 0 color to 0:100:100

      Set LED group to :bbl:`BLUE`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_color pwm-rgb-led 0 0 0 100**
            pwm-rgb-led: setting LED 0 color to 0:0:100

      Set LED group to :bma:`MAGENTA`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_color pwm-rgb-led 0 100 0 100**
            pwm-rgb-led: setting LED 0 color to 100:0:100

      Set LED group to :bwt:`WHITE` (all on):

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_color pwm-rgb-led 0 100 100 100**
            pwm-rgb-led: setting LED 0 color to 100:100:100

      Set LED group to :bbk:`BLACK` (all off):

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_color pwm-rgb-led 0 0 0 0**
            pwm-rgb-led: setting LED 0 color to 0:0:0

   .. group-tab:: LED

      .. note:: **PWM LED conflicts with GPIO!**

         Operations with the user LEDs in PWM mode will fail when ever
         the corresponding GPIO lines were configured as digital output.
         This condition is irreversible at runtime within the shell and
         :strong:`requires a system reset`.

      Operate with the blue user LED :hwftlbl-led:`LED_B`
      at :rpi-pico-pio:`GP8` / :rpi-pico-pwm:`PWM8` (PWM4CHA):

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led on pwm-leds 2**
            pwm-leds: turning on LED 2

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_brightness pwm-leds 2 10**
            pwm-leds: setting LED 2 brightness to 10

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_brightness pwm-leds 2 50**
            pwm-leds: setting LED 2 brightness to 50

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led set_brightness pwm-leds 2 100**
            pwm-leds: setting LED 2 brightness to 100

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led off pwm-leds 2**
            pwm-leds: turning off LED 2

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led blink pwm-leds 2 50 50**
            pwm-leds: blinking LED 2 with 50 ms on and 50 ms off

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **led off pwm-leds 2**
            pwm-leds: turning off LED 2

   .. group-tab:: PWM

      .. note:: **PWM conflicts with GPIO!**

         Operations with the user LEDs in PWM mode will fail when ever
         the corresponding GPIO lines were configured as digital output.
         This condition is irreversible at runtime within the shell and
         :strong:`requires a system reset`.

      Operate with the green user LED :hwftlbl-led:`LED_G`
      at :rpi-pico-pio:`GP7` / :rpi-pico-pwm:`PWM7` (PWM3CHB):

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 20000 1**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 19000 1**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 18000 1**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 17000 1**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 16000 1**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 15000 1**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 10000 1**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 5000 1**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 2500 1**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 500 1**

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **pwm usec pwm 7 20000 0 1**

   .. group-tab:: GPIO

      Operate with the user button :hwftlbl-btn:`SW_X`
      at :rpi-pico-pio:`GP14`:

      .. container:: highlight highlight-console notranslate

         .. parsed-literal::

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio get gpio0 14**
            0

            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio conf gpio0 14 iul**
            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio get gpio0 14**
            0
            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio get gpio0 14**
            1
            :bgn:`uart:~$` **gpio get gpio0 14**
            0
